    "evidence": "The red-mutator/blue-defense framing, emphatic editorial headline, neon duotone, and fraud-phylogeny concept give the screen a recognizable identity. However, the dominant experience remains familiar dark-dashboard cards, a basic line chart, status pills, and pipeline tiles; on tablet/mobile the distinctive phylogeny becomes a plain mutation list, weakening the signature visual idea.",
